Third-party data
----------------
rosen_halgren_submatrix.json is a subset of the whole-cortex probabilistic
diffusion tractography connectome of Rosen, B. Q. & Halgren, E. "A whole-cortex
probabilistic diffusion tractography connectome", eNeuro 8, ENEURO.0416-20.2020
(2021), published under CC BY 4.0 (Copyright (c) 2021 Rosen and Halgren). The
values were selected for the parcels of the 11 ROIs and are redistributed with
attribution under the same license. If you use this file, cite Rosen and
Halgren (2021). Their connectome was computed from data of the WU-Minn Human
Connectome Project (Principal Investigators David Van Essen and Kamil Ugurbil;
1U54MH091657).
